From d85572f381e048e23434aa7af0c01d0dabe5e799 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 04:40:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(catalog): invalidate free-model cache and OpenRouter hold
 on content change

Use SHA-256 of config/openrouter.free-models.json (BOM-normalized) so rewrites
refresh the in-memory snapshot and bypass consultation holds even when mtime is
unchanged. Byte-identical rewrites after normalization remain a documented limit.
---
